ty" data-astro-cid-v23yzkyf>Crawl, scrape and search on one host. Whole sites stream back as markdown, in order.</p></li><li class="flex flex-col min-w-0 border-[hsl(var(--md-rule)/0.6)] gap-3 border-t md:border-l md:border-t-0 pb-6 pt-8 px-5 relative sm:pb-7 sm:px-6" data-astro-cid-v23yzkyf><div class=pl-tabs data-astro-cid-v23yzkyf><a class="con-tab spec-host" href=/browser/ data-astro-cid-v23yzkyf style=text-transform:none;letter-spacing:.06em>browser.spider.cloud </a><span class="con-tab con-tab-r spec-note" data-astro-cid-v23yzkyf style=text-transform:none>WS</span></div><span class="text-foreground [font-optical-sizing:auto] font-[500] font-display text-[2.75rem] tabular-nums tracking-[-0.04em] block leading-[1] lg:text-[3.25rem] sm:text-[3rem]" data-astro-cid-v23yzkyf>100% </span><span class="text-muted-foreground font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[11px] block leading-[1.4]" data-astro-cid-v23yzkyf>browser fidelity bench v1</span><p class="text-muted-foreground font-mono text-[12px] leading-[1.65] max-w-[24rem] text-pretty" data-astro-cid-v23yzkyf>Spider, 80 tasks, Sep 18, 2026. Real production sites. <a class="text-foreground transition-colors hover:text-muted-foreground decoration-muted-foreground/60 underline underline-offset-4" href=https://github.com/spider-rs/benchmark rel=noreferrer target=_blank data-astro-cid-v23yzkyf>See the results <span aria-hidden=true data-astro-cid-v23yzkyf>&rarr;</span></a></p></li><li class="flex flex-col min-w-0 border-[hsl(var(--md-rule)/0.6)] gap-3 border-t md:border-l md:border-t-0 pb-6 pt-8 px-5 relative sm:pb-7 sm:px-6" data-astro-cid-v23yzkyf><div class=pl-tabs data-astro-cid-v23yzkyf><a class="con-tab spec-host" href=/proxy-locations/ data-astro-cid-v23yzkyf style=text-transform:none;letter-spacing:.06em>proxy.spider.cloud </a><span class="con-tab con-tab-r spec-note" data-astro-cid-v23yzkyf style=text-transform:none>HTTP</span></div><span class="text-foreground [font-optical-sizing:auto] font-[500] font-display text-[2.75rem] tabular-nums tracking-[-0.04em] block leading-[1] lg:text-[3.25rem] sm:text-[3rem]" data-astro-cid-v23yzkyf>215M+ </span><span class="text-muted-foreground font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[11px] block leading-[1.4]" data-astro-cid-v23yzkyf>exits in 199 countries</span><p class="text-muted-foreground font-mono text-[12px] leading-[1.65] max-w-[24rem] text-pretty" data-astro-cid-v23yzkyf>Residential and ISP addresses, rotated per request. The same network runs the crawler and the browser.</p></li></ul><div class="flex flex-col min-w-0 border-[hsl(var(--md-rule)/0.6)] border-t relative pt-8 sm:px-6 gap-y-8 pb-7 sm:pb-9 sm:pt-10" data-astro-cid-v23yzkyf><a class="con-tab con-tab-r spec-all" href=/docs/integrations/overview/ data-astro-cid-v23yzkyf>Integrations<span aria-hidden=true data-astro-cid-v23yzkyf>&rarr;</span></a><nav aria-label=Integrations class="items-center flex py-2 gap-x-6 overflow-x-auto px-5 sm:gap-x-5 sm:grid sm:grid-cols-8 sm:overflow-visible sm:px-0 sm:py-0 spec-logos" data-astro-cid-v23yzkyf><a class="items-center no-underline justify-center focus-visible:outline-2 duration-300 flex focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-foreground focus-visible:outline-offset-4 grayscale group hover:grayscale-0 shrink-0 sm:shrink sm:w-full transition-[filter] w-[88px]" href=https://docs.crewai.com/en/tools/web-scraping/spidertool#spider-scraper rel=noreferrer target=_blank data-astro-cid-v23yzkyf><svg viewBox="0 0 391 388" class="h-[28px] max-w-[88px] sm:h-[32px] sm:max-w-[96px] w-full" height=32 width=96 xmlns=http://www.w3.org/2000/svg><title>CrewAI Logo</title><g><path d="M268.367 57.9297C277.564 65.162 286.285 72.2951 293 82C293.845 83.1988 293.845 83.1988 294.707 84.4219C302.722 96.6678 303.618 110.468 300.87 124.581C297.199 141.6 289.854 156.699 282.265 172.228C277.241 182.51 272.255 192.728 268.875 203.688C267.376 208.421 265.995 211.029 262 214C254.946 216.351 250.36 215.05 243.875 211.813C230.934 205.198 222.42 194.549 21