0-.401.02-.6.048a4.17 4.17 0 0 0-1.17-3.552A4.16 4.16 0 0 0 13.85 0m0 3.333a.84.84 0 0 0-.59.245L6.275 10.56a4.186 4.186 0 0 0 0 5.902 4.186 4.186 0 0 0 5.902 0L19.16 9.48a.835.835 0 0 0 0-1.18.835.835 0 0 0-1.18 0l-6.985 6.984a2.49 2.49 0 0 1-3.54 0 2.49 2.49 0 0 1 0-3.54l6.983-6.985a.835.835 0 0 0 0-1.18.84.84 0 0 0-.59-.245" class="dark:fill-white fill-black"></path></svg> <span class=sr-only data-astro-cid-v23yzkyf>MCP</span></a></nav></div></div></section><section class="min-w-0 w-full lg:px-16 max-w-site md:px-12 mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:pt-36 md:pt-32 pt-24 hs-defer hs-reveal" data-astro-cid-w4p3l6me aria-labelledby=home-products-title style=--hs-h0:1574px;--hs-h1:1572px;--hs-h2:1675px;--hs-h3:676px><div class=max-w-[45rem]><h2 class="text-foreground [font-optical-sizing:auto] font-[500] font-display text-balance scroll-m-20 tracking-[-0.03em] leading-[1.05] lg:text-[3rem] sm:text-[2.5rem] text-[2rem]" id=home-products-title>Scraping API, browser, proxy. One key.</h2><p class="text-muted-foreground text-pretty leading-[1.55] max-w-[38rem] mt-4 text-lg">Start with the API. The browser and the proxies each work on their own, on the same key. The trace below is one crawl through all three.</p></div><div class="flex min-w-0 bg-background con-tick h-[52px] items-stretch lg:mt-12 mt-10"><span class=con-tab>authentication</span> <span class="text-muted-foreground items-center font-mono hidden px-[18px] sm:flex text-[14px]" aria-hidden=true>$</span><p class="items-center flex gap-2 flex-1 font-mono m-0 min-w-0 px-4 sm:pl-0 text-foreground text-sm"><span class="overflow-x-auto whitespace-nowrap"><span class=text-muted-foreground>export </span>SPIDER_API_KEY<span class=text-muted-foreground>="</span>&lt;YOUR_API_KEY&gt;<span class=text-muted-foreground>"</span></span></p><a class="items-center inline-flex transition-colors no-underline font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.14em] bg-foreground hover:bg-foreground/90 text-background text-2xs border-[hsl(var(--md-rule))] border-l gap-2.5 h-full px-5 shrink-0" href=/api-keys/ >Get a key <span class=opacity-50 aria-hidden=true>&rarr;</span></a></div><div class="flex flex-col min-w-0 bg-background con-tick mt-7" data-hp-state=idle data-hp-trace data-hp-trigger=view><ol class="grid grid-cols-1 border-t border-[hsl(var(--md-rule))] lg:grid-cols-3" role=list><li class="flex flex-col min-w-0 relative"><div class=pl-tabs aria-hidden=true><span class=con-tab style=text-transform:none>api.spider.cloud </span><span class="con-tab con-tab-r grid hp-reading" style=text-transform:none><span class="text-muted-foreground hp-u" style=--hp-t:0ms;--hp-u:2810ms>waiting </span><span class="dark:text-brand-400 text-brand-700 hp-s" style=--hp-t:2810ms>200 · 30 pages</span></span></div><h3 class="text-foreground uppercase [font-optical-sizing:auto] font-[500] font-display leading-[1.15] tracking-[0.02em] sm:text-[1.75rem] text-[1.5rem] text-balance tracking-[-0.02em] pt-10 px-5 sm:px-8">The API</h3><p class=sr-only>Step one of an example trace, captured 2026-09-09. The API receives POST /crawl for doc.rust-lang.org/book with a limit of 30 and streams back 30 pages of markdown, 319 kilobytes in all, with status 200. Every page came back 200. demo-01 is an illustrative correlation id, not an API field.</p><div class="min-w-0 px-5 sm:px-8 pt-5"><div class="min-w-0 border-[hsl(var(--md-rule)/0.6)] border overflow-hidden relative aspect-[16/10] lg:aspect-[16/10] sm:aspect-[21/9]" aria-hidden=true><div class="absolute inset-0 hp-grain"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 p-4 sm:p-5"><div class="flex flex-col min-w-0 h-full justify-center py-3 relative"><svg viewBox="0 0 400 300" class="min-h-0 w-full flex-1" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet"><rect height=208 width=156 fill=hsl(var(--background)) stroke=hsl(var(--foreground)/0.22) stroke-width=1 vector-effect=non-scaling-stroke x=106.04999999999998 y=61.95><title>/appendix-01-keywords.html · 5 KB · 200</title></rect><rect height=208 width=156 fill=hsl(var(--background)) stroke=hsl(var(--foreground)/0.22) stroke-width=1 vector-effect=non-scaling-stroke x=107.14999999999998 y=60.85><title>/ch20-02-advanced-traits.html · 25 KB · 200</title></rect><rect height=208 width=156 fill=hsl(var(--background)) stroke=hsl(var(--foreground)/0.22) stroke-width=1 vector-effect=non-scaling-stroke x=108.24999999999999 y=59.75><title>/ch07-03-paths-for-referring-to-an-item-in-the-module-tree.html · 17 KB · 200</title></rect><rect height=208 width=156 fill=hsl(var(--background)) stroke=hsl(var(--foreground)/0.22) stroke-width=1 vector-effect=non-scaling-stroke x=109.35 y=58.65><title>/ch05-00-structs.html · 1 KB · 200</title></rect><rect height=208 width=156 fill=hsl(var(--background)) stroke=hsl(var(--foreground)/0.22) stroke-width=1 vector-effect=non-scaling-stroke x=110.44999999999999 y=57.55><title>/ch18-02-trait-objects.html · 14 KB · 200</title></rect><rect height=208 width=156 fill=hsl(var(--background)) stroke=hsl(var(--foreground)/0.22) stroke-width=1 vector-effect=non-scaling-stroke x=111.54999999999998 y=56.45><title>/ch04-00-understanding-ownership.html · 1 KB · 200</title></rect><rect height=208 width=156 fill=hsl(var(--background)) stroke=hsl(var(--foreground)/0.22) stroke-width=1 vector-effect=non-scaling-stroke x=112.64999999999999 y=55.349999999999994><title>/ch20-03-advanced-types.html · 15 KB · 200</title></rect><rect height=208 width=156 fill=hsl(var(--background)) stroke=hsl(var(--foreground)/0.22) stroke-width=1 vector-effect=non-scaling-stroke x=113.74999999999999 y=54.25><title>/ch21-01-single-threaded.html · 25 KB · 200</title></rect><rect height=208 width=156 fill=hsl(var(--background)) stroke=hsl(var(--foreground)/0.22) stroke-width=1 vector-effect=non-scaling-stroke x=114.85 y=53.15><title>/ch10-02-traits.html · 21 KB · 200</title></rect><rect height=208 width=156 fill=hsl(var(--background)) stroke=hsl(var(--foreground)/0.22) stroke-width=1 vector-effect=non-scaling-stroke x=115.94999999999999 y=52.05><title>/ch03-00-commo