text-2xs" data-astro-cid-jmq6zs5r>AGENTS.md</span><div class="flex flex-col min-w-0 border-[hsl(var(--md-rule)/0.6)] gap-3 bg-background border items-start px-3 py-2 sm:flex-row" data-astro-cid-jmq6zs5r data-home-copy><pre class="font-mono leading-[1.6] min-w-0 [overflow-wrap:anywhere] flex-1 text-[12.5px] text-foreground w-full whitespace-pre-wrap" data-astro-cid-jmq6zs5r>For web pages use spider-agent. Read https://spider.cloud/agent-skill/spider-agent/SKILL.md first.</pre><button class="text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground transition-colors font-mono uppercase text-2xs whitespace-nowrap focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:text-foreground tracking-[0.14em] focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-foreground focus-visible:outline-offset-2 min-w-[19ch] self-end shrink-0 sm:self-start text-right w-[19ch]" type=button data-astro-cid-jmq6zs5r aria-label="Copy this snippet" data-home-copy-btn>copy</button></div><p class="text-muted-foreground max-w-[34rem] leading-[1.5] text-[13.5px]" data-astro-cid-jmq6zs5r>Or the CLI. It picks HTTP or a browser per page, stops at your budget, and returns 187 bytes for named fields where asking for everything returns 9021.</p></div><a class="items-center inline-flex transition-colors gap-1.5 no-underline font-mono hover:text-muted-foreground text-foreground text-xs tracking-[0.14em] uppercase self-start" href=/docs/integrations/agent-cli/ data-home-cta=home_setup_docs data-astro-cid-jmq6zs5r>Every command in the docs <span data-astro-cid-jmq6zs5r aria-hidden=true>&rarr;</span></a></div><div class="flex flex-col min-w-0 px-5 gap-4 sm:px-8 py-7 [grid-area:1/1] invisible" data-astro-cid-jmq6zs5r aria-hidden=true aria-labelledby=home-setup-tab-agent-cli data-home-panel=agent-cli id=home-setup-panel-agent-cli role=tabpanel inert><h3 class="flex items-baseline gap-3" data-astro-cid-jmq6zs5r><span class="text-muted-foreground font-mono tracking-[0.14em] text-2xs tabular-nums" data-astro-cid-jmq6zs5r>02</span> <span class="text-foreground uppercase [font-optical-sizing:auto] font-[500] font-display leading-[1.15] tracking-[0.02em] text-[1.25rem]" data-astro-cid-jmq6zs5r>Install the CLI and run it</span></h3><div class="flex flex-col min-w-0 gap-2" data-astro-cid-jmq6zs5r><div class="flex flex-col min-w-0 border-[hsl(var(--md-rule)/0.6)] gap-3 bg-background border items-start px-3 py-2 sm:flex-row" data-astro-cid-jmq6zs5r data-home-copy><pre class="font-mono leading-[1.6] min-w-0 [overflow-wrap:anywhere] flex-1 text-[12.5px] text-foreground w-full whitespace-pre-wrap" data-astro-cid-jmq6zs5r>curl -fsSL https://spider.cloud/install/spider-agent.sh | sh</pre><button class="text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground transition-colors font-mono uppercase text-2xs whitespace-nowrap focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:text-foreground tracking-[0.14em] focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-foreground focus-visible:outline-offset-2 min-w-[19ch] self-end shrink-0 sm:self-start text-right w-[19ch]" type=button data-astro-cid-jmq6zs5r aria-label="Copy this snippet" data-home-copy-btn>copy</button></div><p class="text-muted-foreground max-w-[34rem] leading-[1.5] text-[13.5px]" data-astro-cid-jmq6zs5r>Downloads the release build, checks its SHA256, and puts it in ~/.local/bin. With a Rust toolchain, cargo install spider-agent-cli works too.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col min-w-0 gap-2" data-astro-cid-jmq6zs5r><div class="flex flex-col min-w-0 border-[hsl(var(--md-rule)/0.6)] gap-3 bg-background border items-start px-3 py-2 sm:flex-row" data-astro-cid-jmq6zs5r data-home-copy><pre class="font-mono leading-[1.6] min-w-0 [overflow-wrap:anywhere] flex-1 text-[12.5px] text-foreground w-full whitespace-pre-wrap" data-astro-cid-jmq6zs5r>spider-agent scrape https://example.com --goal markdown --json</pre><button class="text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground transition-colors font-mono uppercase text-2xs whitespace-nowrap focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:text-foreground tracking-[0.14em] focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-foreground focus-visible:outline-offset-2 min-w-[19ch] self-end shrink-0 sm:self-start text-right w-[19ch]" type=button data-astro-cid-jmq6zs5r aria-label="Copy this snippet" data-home-copy-btn>copy</button></div><p class="text-muted-foreground max-w-[34rem] leading-[1.5] text-[13.5px]" data-astro-cid-jmq6zs5r>Picks HTTP or a browser per page, escalates on a refusal, stops at the budget you set.</p></div><a class="items-center inline-flex transition-colors gap-1.5 no-underline font-mono hover:text-muted-foreground text-foreground text-xs tracking-[0.14em] uppercase self-start" href=/docs/integrations/agent-cli/ data-home-cta=home_setup_docs data-astro-cid-jmq6zs5r>Every command in the docs <span data-astro-cid-jmq6zs5r aria-hidden=true>&rarr;</span></a></div><div class="flex flex-col min-w-0 px-5 gap-4 sm:px-8 py-7 [grid-area:1/1] invisible" data-astro-cid-jmq6zs5r aria-hidden=true aria-labelledby=home-setup-tab-mcp data-home-panel=mcp id=home-setup-panel-mcp role=tabpanel inert><h3 class="flex items-baseline gap-3" data-astro-cid-jmq6zs5r><span class="text-muted-foreground font-mono tracking-[0.14em] text-2xs tabular-nums" data-astro-cid-jmq6zs5r>02</span> <span class="text-foreground uppercase [font-optical-sizing:auto] font-[500] font-display leading-[1.15] tracking-[0.02em] text-[1.25rem]" data-astro-cid-jmq6zs5r>Connect your MCP client</span></h3><div class="flex flex-col min-w-0 gap-2" data-astro-cid-jmq6zs5r><div class="flex flex-col min-w-0 border-[hsl(var(--md-rule)/0.6)] gap-3 bg-background border items-start px-3 py-2 sm:flex-row" data-astro-cid-jmq6zs5r data-home-copy><pre class="font-mono leading-[1.6] min-w-0 [overflow-wrap:anywhere] flex-1 text-[12.5px] text-foreground w-full whitespace-pre-wrap" data-astro-cid-jmq6zs5r>Endpoint:  https://mcp.spider.cloud/mcp
